      "id": "claim_2ceaef18fe93411cbe4caaae05e59e00",
      "statement": "tabId targeting is stateless and per-call: there is no session-level selected tab, mirroring browserInstanceId. When tabId is omitted, every layer falls back to the active foreground tab, preserving backward compatibility for single-tab callers.",
