      "statement": "BrijioBackgroundController.handleSocketMessage calls extractTabId(message) once to read message.target.tabId, validate it is a non-empty string, parse it to a number, and pass that numeric tabId to the page context, page content, action, navigation, and batch handlers; absent or invalid tabId yields undefined (active-tab fallback).",
